WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:08.602
Hello! Welcome to NariShakti. Today we will learn what periods,

00:00:08.602 --> 00:00:11.386
or menstruation, are.

00:00:12.086 --> 00:00:16.850
First things first: periods are not an illness.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:21.614
They are a healthy, normal process of the body.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:28.117
Every month the uterus builds a soft lining inside it,

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:31.986
so that it is ready for a pregnancy.

00:00:32.686 --> 00:00:39.598
Around the same time, an ovary releases an egg.

00:00:40.298 --> 00:00:47.687
If there is no pregnancy, this lining leaves the body through the vagina as blood.

00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:49.850
This is called a period.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:59.739
The time from the first day of one period to the first day of the next is called the menstrual cycle.

00:00:59.739 --> 00:01:02.286
It is usually about 28 days.

00:01:02.986 --> 00:01:10.906
But every body is different. A cycle of 21 to 35 days is also completely normal.

00:01:11.606 --> 00:01:16.118
Bleeding usually lasts three to seven days.

00:01:16.818 --> 00:01:23.442
For most girls, periods start between the ages of ten and fifteen.

00:01:24.142 --> 00:01:30.897
For the first year or two, it is normal for the cycle to shift around.

00:01:30.897 --> 00:01:33.406
Slowly it becomes regular.

00:01:34.106 --> 00:01:41.234
Mild pain or cramps in the lower belly during periods are common.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:46.341
Some women feel tired or have mood changes.

00:01:46.341 --> 00:01:50.646
This happens because of changing hormones.

00:01:51.346 --> 00:01:59.122
A hot water bottle, drinking plenty of water and a light walk can bring relief.

00:01:59.822 --> 00:02:03.144
See a doctor if you notice these signs:

00:02:03.144 --> 00:02:10.214
bleeding for more than seven days, or a pad soaking through every one to two hours.

00:02:10.914 --> 00:02:15.603
Also talk to a doctor if the pain stops your daily work,

00:02:15.603 --> 00:02:21.882
or if your period does not come for three months when you are not pregnant.

00:02:22.582 --> 00:02:30.838
So remember: periods are natural. There is nothing impure or shameful about them.

00:02:31.538 --> 00:02:35.577
Record your cycle in NariShakti's Tracker,

00:02:35.577 --> 00:02:39.520
and talk openly with your mother, sister,

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:45.482
friend or doctor. Now check what you learnt with a short quiz!
